    853  f102							; (2026-10-15) GRP0 blank REMOVED: +5c pushed the rows0/1 setup
    854  f102							; segment to 75c armed (>=74 = write lands next line = +1 stall line
    855  f102							; = whole-screen shift). The blank only traded a stale-byte duplicate
    856  f102							; for a blank line at band boundaries — shipped pre-99b8e86 without
    857  f102							; either; case15 filters zero writes so the Y-align guard is unaffected.
    858  f102							; --- Scanlines this pass: rows 0/1 = 48; row 2 = 36+off (tide, CollisionX).
    859  f102							; The bottom water strip (last 12-off lines, bottom_band_plan rule 2)
