   1972  f58d							; BombTick — per-frame state machine (overscan).
   1973  f58d							;   state1 fuse: dec BombTimer, at 0 → state=2 timer=60 (blast = S5/S6/S9)
   1974  f58d							;   state2: dec BombTimer, at 0 → state=0 (mask stays; saved on EnterRoom)
   1975  f58d							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1976  f58d				   BombTick   subroutine
   1977  f58d		       a5 b5		      lda	BombPacked
