   2210  f697							; flicker counter — with no objects the modulo below never runs, so
   2211  f697							; FlickerFrame would grow unbounded and .SOModLoop (a subtract loop)
   2212  f697							; would run O(FlickerFrame) iterations in the VBL on the next room with
