   2327  f73a							; "stage or park ObjTop". The old `bmi` sentinel test died with the 16-row
   2328  f73a							; stride: OBJ_BOMB = 128 = $80 sets bit 7, so the bomb's P1 was never
   2329  f73a							; positioned and its ObjTop was parked (tools/test_bomb_render_x.py).
   2330  f73a							; It is ONE comparison because the VBL window pays for 2 c but not the
   2331  f73a							; 6 c that three `cmp/beq` sites cost (test_phase3_ball: 268-line frames).
   2332  f73a							; RULE: never test ObjBase/ObjBase1 with `bmi` — $FF is the ONLY
