   2410  f78e							; The frame's ONE HMOVE already ran in the VBL; this second one exists only
   2411  f78e							; for slot 1's own fine adjust. HMP0/HMM0/HMBL still hold the PLAYER's,
   2412  f78e							; the laser's and the ball's fine values, and HMOVE would apply them a
   2413  f78e							; second time — the player's fine adjust doubled (drawn X advanced 2 px per
   2414  f78e							; 1 px of RoomX, sawing +/-15 px as the fine value cycled: the "raft
   2415  f78e							; zig-zag", user 2026-10-22). Clear them; HMP1 stays (set above).
